    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">One‑quarter tank fuel regulation</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Reduce the fuel level to approximately 25 % of the tank capacity. This limit minimizes weight, reduces the risk of spillage, and complies with most railway safety guidelines for bike parcel service in Tirunelveli and other regions.</p>
