    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">FASTag management</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">If the bike is being moved on toll roads, ensure the FASTag is active and linked to the corporate account of the movers and packers for bike transport. Verify the tag’s balance, attach it securely to the vehicle’s windshield, and record the tag number in the shipment manifest.</p>
